# HighReview Environment Configuration

# GitHub Authentication
# This app uses GitHub CLI (gh) for authentication.
# No token configuration needed - just run: gh auth login

# AI Provider Configuration
# AI providers are selected in the UI (Settings page or main screen).
# No environment variables needed - the app automatically detects installed providers:
# - Claude Code CLI (https://claude.ai/download)
# - Ollama (https://ollama.ai)
# - LM Studio (https://lmstudio.ai)

# Optional: Custom Server Port
# Uncomment to use a different port (default: 8765)
# PORT=8765

# Optional: Custom Data Directory
# Uncomment to use a different data directory (default: ~/.highreview)
# HIGHREVIEW_DATA_DIR=~/.highreview

# Default URLs:
# - Frontend: http://localhost:5273 (development)
# - Backend: http://localhost:8765
